For the record, the Archeologist was not originally patterned after
Jones.  Originally it was Speliologist, and its main distinction was
that it started the game with a pickaxe (which, in those days, were
extremely rare.)  This was changed to Archeologist when they decided
to use 'S' for Samurai, but with no real changes to the character.
Only later (was it 3.0?) did they give him the bullwhip and fedora.


